{"lyrics":"[00:12.22]Got a new .9 that'll leave your mouth wide\n[00:15.08]Leave you hogtied, burnin' on a campfire\n[00:17.88]Before I leave the crib, I pray to God I won't die\n[00:20.80]I know it's hard to kill me, but I know they gon' try\n[00:23.84]You's a pussy boy, yeah, you a feline\n[00:26.76]Get your own business and get out mine\n[00:29.62]Had to kill a witness, ain't doin' no time\n[00:32.54]Watch them niggas around you, they playin' both sides\n[00:35.46]Boy, your gang ain't your gang and your homies, not your homies\n[00:38.38]Run it up, get that sack, but do that shit right by your lonely\n[00:41.24]Choppa hit him with a force like I'm Obi-Wan Kenobi\n[00:44.06]Don't need no court to use my torch, I've been shootin' like I'm Kobe\n[00:47.02]I don't need nobody, I just need your body, ayy-ayy-ayy\n[00:50.02]I'm gon' catch a body if you fuck with my money, ayy-ayy-ayy\n[00:52.90]Mixin' them narcotics, turned me to a zombie\n[00:55.22]Ape with a nigga, Harambe, ull up on a nigga, no talkin'\n[00:57.30]Leave a nigga leakin', no faucet, yeah\n[00:58.64]Stand up to the opps, never back down\n[00:59.96]He'll get beat with the belt like it's SmackDown\n[01:01.60]Studio, juug life, trap house, crack cocaine my track outs\n[01:04.60]Up late night like owls, Backwoods, smokin' on White Owls\n[01:07.54]I got the lean on me right now, got a gun with a beam on me right now\n[01:10.38]Got a new .9 that'll leave your mouth wide\n[01:13.28]Leave you hogtied, burnin' on a campfire\n[01:16.08]Before I leave the crib, I pray to God I won't die\n[01:19.02]I know it's hard to kill me, but I know they gon' try\n[01:22.02]You's a pussy boy, yeah, you a feline\n[01:24.94]Get your own business and get out mine\n[01:27.80]Had to kill a witness, ain't doin' no time\n[01:33.44]Watch them niggas around you, they playin' both sides\n[01:37.42]Had to cut some niggas off, started seein' signs\n[01:42.52]Switchin' sides, drop and die, full of lies, niggas pie\n[01:48.84]I'ma walk with